Setting one key preserves all other frontmatter keys and the body text untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
type: feature
status: backlog
sp: 5
---
# Plan body

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two

-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Test Plan
 type: feature
-status: backlog
+status: in-progress
 sp: 5
 ---
 # Plan body
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=in-progress
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
type: feature
status: in-progress
sp: 5
---
# Plan body

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two

